  title = {Life-{{History Traits}} and {{Landscape Characteristics Predict Macro-Moth Responses}} to {{Forest Fragmentation Life-history Traits}} and {{Landscape Characteristics Predict Macro-Moth Responses}} to {{Forest Fragmentation}}},
